      "writtenOn": "2019-12-04T01:40:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No need to comment on falses, instead, but if you want to, this should say \"An encoded ASN.1 integer missing a leading zero is invalid, but accepted by some implementations.\" (And nit: long enough to move above the entry.)",
      "revId": "f3e003d2489733f204fbbdc38d75be1067803db5",
